Reset your password

Hi <%= email_name_for(@resource) %>,

Someone — hopefully you, or an admin in your household — asked to reset the password for <%= @resource.email %>. Choose a new one here:
<%= edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>

This link works for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Devise.reset_password_within) %>. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password won't change unless you use the link.
